<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="LightRAG">
  <data key="d0">LightRAG</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">LightRAG is an organization renowned for its specialized services in embedding and software system development for text document processing and analysis. It is particularly recognized for its lightweight Knowledge Graph Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system, which supports multiple Large Language Models (LLMs) and is integral to the document processing pipeline. The system's applications include the recognition of equations in documents and serves as a class for integrating and managing Knowledge Graph construction. LightRAG enforces the uniqueness of `canonical_basename` within the same workspace, indicating its role in text data management and system integration. The organization also manages an AI-driven software system for natural language processing and content generation, which includes a React-based WebUI frontend. LightRAG is configured through a wizard and acts as a service that interacts with external databases, providing an API server for managing language models and embeddings. It supports various storage solutions and configurable index types for Milvus vector storage. The term "LightRAG" may also refer to a system that reads and processes text, emphasizing its multifaceted role in text analysis and knowledge graph construction. LightRAG is capable of using multimodal-capable content parsing engines and has a built-in universal file interchange format. It is a tool for managing knowledge bases and serves as a framework for building and querying knowledge graphs. Additionally, LightRAG is a library for creating and managing RAG instances, a procedure for running multiple isolated instances behind one host using a reverse proxy, and a software tool used for online and offline natural language processing tasks. The organization provides a guide for deploying LightRAG in offline environments and represents a class for processing and extracting information. A LightRAG object is used for text retrieval and ranking, and it is a software library for building language models.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of model or system referred to in the text&lt;SEP&gt;An AI system used for generating high-level queries and evaluating performance on those queries.&lt;SEP&gt;An LLM/VLM configuration system that supports different models for various processing stages&lt;SEP&gt;LightRAG is an organization that provides a framework for parsing and processing text.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0aafeecd87977e0b223226d601274fda-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8b9291b4c9b5aad9fbc21176a5512b06-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e6feded9a78d192aeef37c71e96361d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8b4d4a34c28646786713dd9d097373d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8b4d4a34c28646786713dd9d097373d4-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d37ce0e26a92a51f4827fa69633d38eb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d37ce0e26a92a51f4827fa69633d38eb-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e53a52ad2aa33fe5e544e0301b8ee9d8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-558e38006bd5ca5454199c44ecff32cd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a1c50a7f3809140ca9c7d7176ff5b4ed-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a1c50a7f3809140ca9c7d7176ff5b4ed-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-32de6cb75d6f34ce510d7695c3261a3b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-32de6cb75d6f34ce510d7695c3261a3b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a583d83915dae1536924c9149ccfaa0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a7e545539453c5dfacd0828fae0fc39-chunk-002</data>
