<node id="Configuration">
  <data key="d0">Configuration</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A general term for any setting or arrangement of parts or elements.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of setting up LightRAG involves various configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of setting up and customizing the behavior of a system&lt;SEP&gt;The set of configurations for various parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;The settings and parameters for the project.</data>
