<node id="LightRAG Server">
  <data key="d0">LightRAG Server</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The LightRAG Server is a multifunctional server component that serves as the core of the LightRAG system. It is primarily responsible for processing documents, which includes configuring and managing the system. The server loads environment variables from the `.env` file, ensuring that the system operates with the necessary settings. In addition to document processing, the LightRAG Server handles queries, providing both a Web UI and API support for document indexing, knowledge graph exploration, and the RAG query interface. It is designed to facilitate document indexing and RAG queries, making it an integral part of the LightRAG system. Furthermore, the server offers a REST API, enabling integration into various projects and enhancing its versatility as a tool for managing and processing documents within the LightRAG ecosystem.&lt;SEP&gt;A server used for managing and running the LightRAG system</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9a583d83915dae1536924c9149ccfaa0-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786009390</data>
