<node id="process_options">
  <data key="d0">process_options</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The process_options entity is a data element that encapsulates the processing options for a file. It serves as a collection of processing options that are read by subsequent pipeline stages in a processing workflow. This component is instrumental in selecting the chunking strategy, which is a critical aspect of the processing options. The options used for processing the chunking are part of the process_options entity, which also includes the original processing options string recorded at enqueue time. This string is utilized to determine the processing policies that will be applied. Additionally, process_options encompasses the options for processing documents, which are used during the document processing phase. The entity also includes the inclusion of 'P' as part of the processing options, indicating a specific parameter or setting relevant to the document processing process.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786008624</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MINERU_API_MODE">
  <data key="d0">MINERU_API_MODE</data>
  <data key="d1">environmentvariable</data>
  <data key="d2">An environment variable that configures the MinerU API mode.&lt;SEP&gt;An environment variable used to set the API mode for the MinerU engine.&lt;SEP&gt;A environment variable used to configure the access mode for the MinerU File Parsing Engine&lt;SEP&gt;An environment variable that specifies the access mode for MinerU.&lt;SEP&gt;An environment variable representing the API mode for MINERU.&lt;SEP&gt;An environment variable that specifies the API mode for MinerU</data>
