<node id="chunk_token_size">
  <data key="d0">chunk_token_size</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The chunk_token_size is a data element that represents the size of tokens used for chunking in a strategy. It defines the maximum number of tokens a chunk can contain and is crucial for controlling the chunk size during the document splitting process. This parameter sets the target token size for a text chunk, ensuring consistency in the chunking of documents. The chunk_token_size is also the size of a chunk token and the size of the chunk tokens used in the system. It is a method used to manage the size of chunks and is a parameter to be set when splitting documents to determine the maximum token size per chunk.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786009130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="chunk_overlap_token_size">
  <data key="d0">chunk_overlap_token_size</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The chunk_overlap_token_size is a data element that represents the size of the overlap between adjacent text fragments or chunks within a strategy. It specifies the maximum number of tokens that can overlap, acting as a token count threshold for chunking. This overlap size is quantified in tokens and is a structured piece of information that characterizes the extent of continuity between chunks. While the size of this overlap is a critical factor in the effectiveness of chunking strategies, a default value may be used to ensure consistent processing across different scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;The size of the overlapping tokens between chunks in the system.&lt;SEP&gt;The chunk overlap token size for chunking&lt;SEP&gt;A parameter to set the overlap token size between two chunks when splitting documents.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ce3beac28f955cae00646a6f9e69a70-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786009126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
