  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A data element that represents the number of references to drop from the tail of a document.&lt;SEP&gt;The default value for the detection knob `CHUNK_P_REFERENCES_TAIL_N` which is used to specify the number of references to consider at the end of a text.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-002</data>
