  <data key="d0">CHUNK_P_REFERENCES_HEADINGS</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">A data element that represents the headings to identify references in a document.&lt;SEP&gt;The default value for the detection knob `CHUNK_P_REFERENCES_HEADINGS` which is used to specify the headings to consider for references.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
