<node id="parse_engine">
  <data key="d0">parse_engine</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A field used to store the engine parameters for a document's parsing request.&lt;SEP&gt;The field represents the engine that actually completed extraction, such as legacy, native, mineru, or docling.&lt;SEP&gt;The engine used for parsing documents.&lt;SEP&gt;A string representing the type of parsing engine used, such as `native/mineru/docling/legacy`.&lt;SEP&gt;A field that contains the name of the parsing engine used.&lt;SEP&gt;Parameter for specifying the engine to use for parsing</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d37ce0e26a92a51f4827fa69633d38eb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d37ce0e26a92a51f4827fa69633d38eb-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a7e545539453c5dfacd0828fae0fc39-chunk-000</data>
