<node id="mineru">
  <data key="d0">mineru</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Mineru is a multifaceted entity that encompasses various functionalities and roles. It serves as an engine designed to invalidate the cache and re-parse file content upon upload, ensuring that the latest data is processed. Additionally, Mineru acts as an external content extraction engine, capable of extracting information from various file formats such as docx, pdf, txt, and others, for local processing. As an artifact, Mineru retains the original file content to facilitate the parsing pipeline. It is also a specific path or system within a larger context. Furthermore, Mineru is an organization that specializes in detecting headings based on text level or label, providing a method for this detection. Additionally, the organization is involved in the production of parsers, contributing to the development and implementation of parsing technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;Built-in parsing engine for PDF/Office documents, calls MinerU service&lt;SEP&gt;A parser implementation&lt;SEP&gt;mineru is an organization that provides a parser for certain file formats.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c23c1da1b37f05359c98c1d67e825dee-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a7e545539453c5dfacd0828fae0fc39-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a7e545539453c5dfacd0828fae0fc39-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786009781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="docling">
  <data key="d0">docling</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The entity "docling" encompasses several functionalities and roles. It is an engine designed to invalidate the cache and re-parse file content upon upload, serving as an external content extraction tool. As a type of artifact, docling retains the original file for the pipeline to parse, which is particularly useful for processing docx, pdf, txt, and other file formats. Docling also refers to a specific path or system within a larger organization.

Within this organization, docling acts as a built-in native parsing engine, capable of handling PDF/Office documents and utilizing the docling-serve system. It is not only an engine but also a tool for parsing and analyzing text. Additionally, the organization associated with docling assigns levels to titles and section headers, contributing to the structured processing of documents. While the descriptions indicate that docling is an organization itself, it is also an integral part of a larger entity that produces parsers.&lt;SEP&gt;Another parser implementation</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c23c1da1b37f05359c98c1d67e825dee-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c23c1da1b37f05359c98c1d67e825dee-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a7e545539453c5dfacd0828fae0fc39-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1786009781</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
