<node id="full_docs">
  <data key="d0">full_docs</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">The term "full_docs" refers to a comprehensive collection of documents. It encompasses a dictionary containing detailed information about the documents, serving as a storage location for file enqueue and extraction results. Following successful parsing, the original file is written to this location. Full_docs represents a dataset that includes all documents, which are collected and possibly stored in a database or similar system. This collection is characterized by being fully processed, ensuring that each document is in its complete and refined form. Additionally, the term is used to describe the full documents within the system, indicating its role in managing and organizing complete document content.&lt;SEP&gt;A collection of documents&lt;SEP&gt;The data structure that stores the document information, including the process options and parse format.&lt;SEP&gt;A physical or digital object created by humans, a collection of documents.&lt;SEP&gt;`full_docs` is a collection of fully parsed documents.&lt;SEP&gt;full_docs is a collection of fully parsed documents.&lt;SEP&gt;Complete documents</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1df1634555d20a3b0378d0dc58979df0-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-832e2be61d469cc5f7dd74904c81d721-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a7e545539453c5dfacd0828fae0fc39-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a7e545539453c5dfacd0828fae0fc39-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3a7e545539453c5dfacd0828fae0fc39-chunk-003</data>
