<edge source="LightRAG Server" target="requires">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The LightRAG Server needs the `.env` configuration file in the startup directory.&lt;SEP&gt;The LightRAG Server requires the integration of an LLM and an Embedding Model for document indexing and querying operations.</data>
  <data key="d9">.env configuration file,LLM and Embedding Model</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-497eef1a84c2e1267fe9ef217a5f0106-chunk-001</data>
